longdesc This LaTeX package helps you write documents indicating your
longdesc compliance with cybersecurity requirements. It also helps you
longdesc format your document in a form suitable inside the U.S.
longdesc Department of Defense, by attaching distribution statements,
longdesc destruction notices, organization logos, and security labels to
longdesc it.
